{"id":237,"flavor":[{"games":["Shield","Crystal"],"text":"After doing a handstand to throw off the opponent’s timing, it presents its fancy kick moves."},{"games":["Sword","SoulSilver","FireRed","Silver"],"text":"It launches kicks while spinning. If it spins at high speed, it may bore its way into the ground."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Hitmontop spins on its head at high speed, all the while delivering kicks. This technique is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense at the same time. The Pokémon travels faster spinning than it does walking."},{"games":["Y","HeartGold"],"text":"If you are enchanted by its smooth, dance-like kicks, you may get a closer experience with one than you’d like."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by 10."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum","Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It fights while spinning like a top. The centrifugal force boosts its destructive power by ten."},{"games":["LeafGreen","Gold"],"text":"If you become enchanted by its smooth, elegant, dance-like kicks, you may get drilled hard."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its technique of kicking while spinning is a remarkable mix of both offense and defense. HITMONTOP travel faster spinning than they do walking."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Intimidate","hidden":false,"description":"When the Pokémon enters a battle, it intimidates opposing Pokémon and makes them cower, lowering their Attack stats."},{"name":"Technician","hidden":false,"description":"Powers up weak moves so the Pokémon can deal more damage with them."},{"name":"Steadfast","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon's determination boosts its Speed stat every time it flinches."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":0,"hatchCounter":25,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"urban","color":"Brown","shape":"Upright","evolution":{"id":236,"name":"Tyrogue","condition":null,"child